{"text": "Near a big forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Lived a poor woodcutter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With his wife and two children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boy was called Hansel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the girl was called Gretel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then hard times came. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And there was not enough bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The father was lying in bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And worrying. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His wife said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We must take the children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Into the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We will leave them there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And then we will have more bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The father was very sad. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But at last he agreed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children were too hungry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To sleep. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So they heard everything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Gretel cried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Hansel said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do not worry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will find a way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later he went outside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the white pebbles. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Were shining like silver coins. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He filled his pockets. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And went back to bed.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "e", "a", "r", " ", "a", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "f", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "L", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "p", "o", "o", "r", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", "c", "u", "t", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "i", "t", "h", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "w", "i", "f", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", 